  "title": {
    "zh": "最大元素與索引",
    "en": "The largest element"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "給定一個數字串列。確定清單中具有最大值的元素。列印最大元素的值，然後列印索引號。 \n\n如果最高元素不唯一，則列印第一個實例的索引。<p><strong>Java 注意：</strong> 本章以陣列或 ArrayList 儲存資料；大小固定時優先使用陣列，需要插入或刪除時使用 ArrayList。</p>",
    "en": "Given a list of numbers. Determine the element in the list with the largest value. Print the value of the largest element and then the index number. \n\nIf the highest element is not unique, print the index of the first instance.<p><strong>Java note:</strong> Use arrays for fixed-size data and ArrayList when insertion or removal is required.</p>"
  },
  "hint": {
